  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "How To: Prompt Backpack",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# How To: Prompt Backpack\n\nSaving your best prompts builds a reusable library of ideas. You can revisit what worked and apply strong prompts to new projects.\n\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b3de180f330ee40ef6b766a4cd8841c7-ai-curriculum-societal-impacts.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025-0dc5b1b1-58c4-4fc3-b45d-f4b4ab782f54"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 1:\n\nCreate a new Markdown file (`.md`) in your project and give it a clear, specific name.\n\n<br/>\n\n**Example**: `click-event-prompt.md`\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0d74573f99cb016ffa98568eee34b0cc-Adobe Express - bp.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025-3c723079-029b-4ac7-bc6e-89971d888eb1"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 2:\n\nWrite or paste a prompt that worked well for you into the file.\n\n<br/>\n\n**Tip**: Keep only the prompt itself, not the whole chat.\n\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4ab47f7d7549fb9aa77f8c24572e92ed-Pasted Graphic 23.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025-d32e2e9e-9df7-4f47-b9d5-8580a4d7ca2e",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 3:\n\nClick the three dots next to the Markdown file and click **Save to Backpack**.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5dca1044c7c68ef9e31d2b3e878db7a7-Adobe Express - bp2.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025-ad9adc45-1220-4671-a411-9e842d3eb187"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 4:\n\nLater, open a project and click the plus `+` button to add a new file. Click the **Import from Backpack** to import your Markdown file. Choose your saved prompt file from the dropdown and click Import to Project.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/40924f19a792ab4f452e6d98b0598893-Adobe Express - import.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025-f79b7323-de5d-467d-98be-df20b3922c5d",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 5:\n\nOnce imported, highlight the lines of the prompt you want to use and click **Add to AI Tutor Chat**.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/41c976e89dcd1b2835415c32841562f7-code.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025-493b97c5-99c1-4c8f-9417-1c15f62335be",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Step 6:\n\nIn your AI prompt, reference the imported context so AI knows what it’s using.\n\n<br/>\n\n**Example**: *“Use the imported prompt about click events to check if my handler logic matches.”*",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/65b089930f238a136883f8f8ccdbde9c-Pasted Graphic 24.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025-d0d6acc4-02d5-47f9-bef1-e57dd47e8a91"
      }
    ]
  },
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-23T23:32:38.956+00:00\",\"changed\":[\"cloned from \\\"ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025\\\"\"],\"cloned_from\":\"ai-generated-design-onboarding-prompt-backpack-test-2025\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-23 23:37:31 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":16889,\"changed_by_email\":\"jamila+lb@code.org\"}]"
}]]></config>
